 "formatLabel": "winget", "label": "winget 清单", "meta": true, "recommended": false}, {"id": 606420599, "name": "winget-ClosedWHU.Luotopia.locale.zh-CN.yaml", "size": 813, "downloadCount": 2, "url": "/api/releases/download/v1.1.0%2B15/winget-ClosedWHU.Luotopia.locale.zh-CN.yaml", "githubUrl": "https://github.com/ClosedWHU/Luotopia/releases/download/v1.1.0%2B15/winget-ClosedWHU.Luotopia.locale.zh-CN.yaml", "contentType": "application/octet-stream", "platform": "other", "arch": "unknown", "archLabel": "通用", "format": "winget", "formatLabel": "winget", "label": "winget 清单", "meta": true, "recommended": false}, {"id": 606420578, "name": "winget-ClosedWHU.Luotopia.yaml", "size": 215, "downloadCount": 1, "url": "/api/releases/download/v1.1.0%2B15/winget-ClosedWHU.Luotopia.yaml", "githubUrl": "https://github.com/ClosedWHU/Luotopia/releases/download/v1.1.0%2B15/winget-ClosedWHU.Luotopia.yaml", "contentType": "application/octet-stream", "platform": "other", "arch": "unknown", "archLabel": "通用", "format": "winget", "formatLabel": "winget", "label": "winget 清单", "meta": true, "recommended": false}]}, {"id": 393121486, "tag": "v1.0.1+13", "title": "1.0.1+13", "version": "1.0.1+13", "versionName": "1.0.1", "buildNumber": "13", "body": "## Luotopia 1.0.1+13\n\n本版本聚焦安全增强、课表与课程评价重构、原生平台适配和论坛国际化。\n\n### 新功能\n\n- 安全：分步验证（step-up）覆盖敏感自助操作与账号注销流程。\n- 截图保护：敏感页面（密码、验证码等）自动阻止截屏和录屏，支持引用计数嵌套，退出页面后自动恢复。\n- 课表与课程评价：总课表归档下载、课程详情页、课程评价共享洞察；课程导入支持 WHU 课程备注展示在日程详情中。\n- 项目编辑器：改进选择器交互与表单控件，优化课程草稿展开逻辑。\n- 管理员：任务中心页面改版，审核确认流程与分步验证接入；论坛数据仪表盘（fl_chart 时序图）。\n- 论坛：附件画廊保存、回复草稿持久化、更丰富的用户主页；通知文案国际化（支持中/英/繁中/粤/日/韩/法/西/葡/俄/越共 11 种语言）。\n- WHU 认证：CAS 滑块验证码重绑时自动清除旧会话缓存。\n- 校园邮箱：邮箱模式选择器与原生入口页面。\n- 首页：紧凑日程头部点击切换日期/星期显示。\n- 设备标识：每次安装生成唯一设备身份，原生诊断通道与信任上报。\n- 法律文档：应用内 Markdown 法律文档渲染与缓存，网站同步新增法律文档页面。\n- 字体：MiSans 字体按需加载，网站同步内置字体文件与缓存头。\n- 设置：用户可见的诊断信息板块，热更新移出开发者门槛。\n\n### 改进与修复\n\n- 底部弹窗：预测性底部弹窗提升至键盘上方，避免被遮挡。\n- 底栏动画：底栏 insets 改为即时 snap 而非逐帧动画，减少掉帧。\n- 路由：校园子路由使用显式 MaterialPage 转场动画。\n- 共享组件：改进密码输入框、内容宽度适配、WebView 页面体验。\n- Android：修复华为 EMUI 最近任务列表图标不更新的问题。\n- iOS：修复表单选择器、原生标签栏、双屏方向适配问题。\n- iPad：修复容器布局问题。\n- macOS：修复文件路径与滚动问题。\n- 依赖更新与内部重构，代码质量提升。\n", "prerelease": true, "draft": false, "htmlUrl": "https://github.com/ClosedWHU/Luotopia/releases/tag/v1.0.1%2B13", "publishedAt": "2026-09-21T16:34:19Z", "assets": [{"id": 580292193, "name": "app-arm64-v8a-release.apk", "size": 55535902, "downloadCount": 1295, "url": "/api/releases/download/v1.0.1%2B13/app-arm64-v8a-release.apk", "githubUrl": "https://github.com/ClosedWHU/Luotopia/releases/download/v1.0.1%2B13/app-arm64-v8a-release.apk", "contentType": "application/vnd.android.package-archive", "platform": "android", "arch": "arm64-v8a", "archLabel": "arm64-v8a", "format": "apk", "formatLabel": "APK", "label": "android · arm64-v8a · APK", "meta": false, "recommended": true}, {"id": 580292189, "name": "app-armeabi-v7a-release.apk", "size": 52318586, "downloadCount": 285, "url": "/api/releases/download/v1.0.1%2B13/app-armeabi-v7a-release.apk", "githubUrl": "https://github.com/ClosedWHU/Luotopia/releases/download/v1.0.1%2B13/app-armeabi-v7a-release.apk", "contentType": "application/vnd.android.package-archive", "platform": "android", "arch": "armeabi-v7a", "archLabel": "armeabi-v7a", "format": "apk", "formatLabel": "APK", "label": "android · armeabi-v7a · APK", "meta": false, "recommended": false}, {"id": 580292191, "name": "app-x86_64-release.apk", "size": 54613186, "downloadCount": 52, "url": "/api/releases/download/v1.0.1%2B13/app-x86_64-release.apk", "githubUrl": "https://github.com/ClosedWHU/Luotopia/releases/download/v1.0.1%2B13/app-x86_64-release.apk", "contentType": "application/vnd.android.package-archive", "platform": "android", "arch": "x86_64", "archLabel": "x86_64", "format": "apk", "formatLabel": "APK", "label": "android · x86_64 · APK", "meta": false, "recommended": false}, {"id": 579435008, "name": "luotopia-1.0.1-13-linux-x64.AppImage", "size": 31083000, "downloadCount": 9, "url": "/api/releases/download/v1.0.1%2B13/luo